{
    "background_story": "Edison was a thrill-seeking Italian racing driver who lived for the rush of speed on the autostrada. Growing up in the picturesque town of Monza, he was surrounded by the sounds of revving engines and screeching tires. Edison's passion for racing led him to compete in local tournaments, where he quickly gained a reputation for his fearless driving style. As he honed his skills, he began to participate in high-stakes rallies across Italy, navigating the winding roads and treacherous mountain passes with ease. Edison's dream was to one day compete in the prestigious Mille Miglia, and after years of hard work, he finally got his chance. With his trusty Alfa Romeo by his side, he sped down the autostrada, the wind in his hair, and the roar of the engine in his ears.",
